      "put": {
        "tags": [
          "floating_ip"
        ],
        "summary": "Detach floating_ip",
        "description": "Detach a floating_ip from its virtual_machine.\\\n\\\nThe NAT of the floating ip-address is removed from the torii, but the floating ip-address stays\\\nreserved, so it can be attached to another virtual_machine again. Detaching a floating_ip,\\\nwhich is not attached, has no effect.",
